  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-88d8fc65322dd9989e8049c4",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "当 M = B N̄ 时，控制量在施加前根据反馈增益和参考输入计算得出，并将相同的控制量同时输入到被控对象和状态估值器；饱和非线性项在 x̃ 方程中相互抵消。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "With M = B N̄, the control is computed from feedback gain and reference input before being applied, and the same control is input to both plant and estimator; saturation nonlinearity cancels out of the x̃ equation.",
